#: render_unique_frames/ops.py:10
msgid "When selected, after rendering all keyframes, they will be copied into extra image files until a full sequence is created"
msgstr "选中后，在渲染完所有关键帧后，它们将被复制到额外的图像文件中，直到创建完整序列"

#: render_unique_frames/ops.py:54
